{"seq":1,"slug":"side-effects-lifecycle","title":"副作用与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/architecture/side-effects-lifecycle","wordCount":642,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"副作用与生命周期\">副作用与生命周期</h1><p>Composable 函数应当是纯函数——给定相同输入产生相同 UI 描述、无可观察的副作用。但真实应用不可避免地需要与外部系统交互：启动协程拉取数据、注册/注销监听器、写入日志、请求权限。Compose 通过一组<strong>副作用 API</strong>（Effect handlers）在严格的生命周期契约下安全地执行这些操作，确保副作用与 Composition 的生命周期正确同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>副作用 API 解决的核心问题是：如何让一段有副作用的代码（协程、回调注册、资源申请）的启动/重启/清理与 Composable 的进入/重组/离开保持一致。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Composable 进入 Composition&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;LaunchedEffect 启动&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;DisposableEffect 启动&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D{&quot;key 变化?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[&quot;取消旧协程 → 启动新协程&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[&quot;继续运行&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G{&quot;key 变化?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[&quot;调用 onDispose → 重新执行&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[&quot;继续持有&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; J[&quot;Composable 离开 Composition&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;LaunchedEffect 取消&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; L[&quot;DisposableEffect.onDispose()&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Composable 进入 Composition\"] --&gt; B[\"LaunchedEffect 启动\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"DisposableEffect 启动\"]\n    B --&gt; D{\"key 变化?\"}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[\"取消旧协程 → 启动新协程\"]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[\"继续运行\"]\n    C --&gt; G{\"key 变化?\"}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[\"调用 onDispose → 重新执行\"]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[\"继续持有\"]\n    A --&gt; J[\"Composable 离开 Composition\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"LaunchedEffect 取消\"]\n    J --&gt; L[\"DisposableEffect.onDispose()\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>Key 变化行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>LaunchedEffect(key)</code></td>\n<td>启动协程</td>\n<td>进入时启动，离开时取消</td>\n<td>取消旧协程，启动新协程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DisposableEffect(key)</code></td>\n<td>注册/注销回调</td>\n<td>进入时注册，离开时注销</td>\n<td>调用 onDispose，重新注册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SideEffect</code></td>\n<td>每次成功重组后执行</td>\n<td>无清理，每次重组都执行</td>\n<td>无 key 概念</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rememberCoroutineScope()</code></td>\n<td>获取与 Composition 绑定的 CoroutineScope</td>\n<td>离开时 scope 被取消</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>produceState(key)</code></td>\n<td>将非 Compose 数据源转为 State</td>\n<td>同 LaunchedEffect</td>\n<td>重新生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>snapshotFlow {}</code></td>\n<td>将 Compose State 转为 Flow</td>\n<td>在协程中使用</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"launchedeffect-协程副作用\">LaunchedEffect：协程副作用</h2><p><code>LaunchedEffect</code> 是最常用的副作用 API——在 Composition 中安全地启动协程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun UserProfile(userId: String) {&#10;    var user by remember { mutableStateOf&lt;User?&gt;(null) }&#10;    var error by remember { mutableStateOf&lt;String?&gt;(null) }&#10;&#10;    // key = userId：当 userId 变化时取消旧请求、启动新请求&#10;    LaunchedEffect(userId) {&#10;        try {&#10;            user = repository.getUser(userId)  // suspend 函数&#10;            error = null&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            error = e.message&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // UI 根据状态渲染&#10;    when {&#10;        error != null -&gt; ErrorMessage(error!!)&#10;        user != null -&gt; UserCard(user!!)&#10;        else -&gt; LoadingIndicator()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 常见误用 ❌：LaunchedEffect(Unit) 内读取频繁变化的状态&#10;// 这导致副作用永不重启，读取的是过时值&#10;&#10;// 正确做法 ✅：需要响应的变化放在 key 中&#10;LaunchedEffect(searchQuery) {&#10;    delay(300)  // debounce&#10;    results = repository.search(searchQuery)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun UserProfile(userId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var user by remember { mutableStateOf&#x3C;User?>(null) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var error by remember { mutableStateOf&#x3C;String?>(null) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // key = userId：当 userId 变化时取消旧请求、启动新请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LaunchedEffect(userId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            user = repository.getUser(userId)  // suspend 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            error = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            error = e.message</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // UI 根据状态渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        error != null -> ErrorMessage(error!!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        user != null -> UserCard(user!!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> LoadingIndicator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 常见误用 ❌：LaunchedEffect(Unit) 内读取频繁变化的状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这导致副作用永不重启，读取的是过时值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确做法 ✅：需要响应的变化放在 key 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LaunchedEffect(searchQuery) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(300)  // debounce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    results = repository.search(searchQuery)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"disposableeffect-资源管理\">DisposableEffect：资源管理</h2><p>当需要注册/注销配对操作（如监听器、传感器、系统回调）时使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun LocationTracker(onLocationUpdate: (LatLng) -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    val context = LocalContext.current&#10;&#10;    DisposableEffect(Unit) {&#10;        val locationManager = context.getSystemService&lt;LocationManager&gt;()&#10;        val listener = LocationListener { location -&gt;&#10;            onLocationUpdate(LatLng(location.latitude, location.longitude))&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        locationManager?.requestLocationUpdates(&#10;            LocationManager.GPS_PROVIDER, 1000L, 10f, listener&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        onDispose {&#10;            // 离开 Composition 时注销监听&#10;            locationManager?.removeUpdates(listener)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 生命周期感知的副作用&#10;@Composable&#10;fun LifecycleAwareEffect(onResume: () -&gt; Unit, onPause: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    val lifecycleOwner = LocalLifecycleOwner.current&#10;&#10;    DisposableEffect(lifecycleOwner) {&#10;        val observer = LifecycleEventObserver { _, event -&gt;&#10;            when (event) {&#10;                Lifecycle.Event.ON_RESUME -&gt; onResume()&#10;                Lifecycle.Event.ON_PAUSE -&gt; onPause()&#10;                else -&gt; {}&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.addObserver(observer)&#10;&#10;        onDispose {&#10;            lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.removeObserver(observer)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun LocationTracker(onLocationUpdate: (LatLng) -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val context = LocalContext.current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    DisposableEffect(Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val locationManager = context.getSystemService&#x3C;LocationManager>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val listener = LocationListener { location -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onLocationUpdate(LatLng(location.latitude, location.longitude))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        locationManager?.requestLocationUpdates(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            LocationManager.GPS_PROVIDER, 1000L, 10f, listener</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onDispose {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 离开 Composition 时注销监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            locationManager?.removeUpdates(listener)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生命周期感知的副作用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun LifecycleAwareEffect(onResume: () -> Unit, onPause: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val lifecycleOwner = LocalLifecycleOwner.current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    DisposableEffect(lifecycleOwner) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val observer = LifecycleEventObserver { _, event -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            when (event) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Lifecycle.Event.ON_RESUME -> onResume()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Lifecycle.Event.ON_PAUSE -> onPause()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else -> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.addObserver(observer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onDispose {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.removeObserver(observer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"sideeffect-每次重组后同步\">SideEffect：每次重组后同步</h2><p><code>SideEffect</code> 在每次成功重组后执行，用于将 Compose 状态同步到非 Compose 系统（无清理需求）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun AnalyticsScreen(screenName: String) {&#10;    // 每次重组后（即 screenName 变化后）上报&#10;    SideEffect {&#10;        analytics.setCurrentScreen(screenName)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // ... UI 内容&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AnalyticsScreen(screenName: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 每次重组后（即 screenName 变化后）上报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SideEffect {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        analytics.setCurrentScreen(screenName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ... UI 内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"rememberupdatedstate-闭包刷新\">rememberUpdatedState：闭包刷新</h2><p>当 LaunchedEffect 的协程需要读取最新的 lambda/值，但不希望因为这些值的变化而重启协程时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun TimedDismiss(&#10;    onTimeout: () -&gt; Unit,&#10;    timeoutMs: Long = 3000L&#10;) {&#10;    // 即使 onTimeout lambda 变化，也不重启 LaunchedEffect&#10;    val currentOnTimeout by rememberUpdatedState(onTimeout)&#10;&#10;    LaunchedEffect(Unit) {  // key=Unit，只启动一次&#10;        delay(timeoutMs)&#10;        currentOnTimeout()  // 读取最新的 lambda&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TimedDismiss(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onTimeout: () -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    timeoutMs: Long = 3000L</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 即使 onTimeout lambda 变化，也不重启 LaunchedEffect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val currentOnTimeout by rememberUpdatedState(onTimeout)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LaunchedEffect(Unit) {  // key=Unit，只启动一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(timeoutMs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentOnTimeout()  // 读取最新的 lambda</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"producestate-非-compose-到-state-的桥接\">produceState：非 Compose 到 State 的桥接</h2><p>将回调、Flow、Channel 等非 Compose 数据源转换为 <code>State&lt;T&gt;</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun NetworkStatus(): State&lt;Boolean&gt; {&#10;    return produceState(initialValue = true) {&#10;        val callback = object : ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback() {&#10;            override fun onAvailable(network: Network) { value = true }&#10;            override fun onLost(network: Network) { value = false }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        val cm = context.getSystemService&lt;ConnectivityManager&gt;()&#10;        cm?.registerDefaultNetworkCallback(callback)&#10;&#10;        awaitDispose {&#10;            cm?.unregisterNetworkCallback(callback)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun NetworkStatus(): State&#x3C;Boolean> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return produceState(initialValue = true) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val callback = object : ConnectivityManager.NetworkCallback() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun onAvailable(network: Network) { value = true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun onLost(network: Network) { value = false }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val cm = context.getSystemService&#x3C;ConnectivityManager>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cm?.registerDefaultNetworkCallback(callback)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        awaitDispose {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            cm?.unregisterNetworkCallback(callback)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"snapshotflow-state-到-flow-的桥接\">snapshotFlow：State 到 Flow 的桥接</h2><p>将 Compose State 的变化转换为 Flow，在协程中做进一步处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun ScrollPositionLogger(listState: LazyListState) {&#10;    LaunchedEffect(listState) {&#10;        snapshotFlow { listState.firstVisibleItemIndex }&#10;            .distinctUntilChanged()&#10;            .filter { it &gt; 0 }&#10;            .collect { index -&gt;&#10;                analytics.logScrollPosition(index)&#10;            }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ScrollPositionLogger(listState: LazyListState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LaunchedEffect(listState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        snapshotFlow { listState.firstVisibleItemIndex }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .distinctUntilChanged()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .filter { it > 0 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .collect { index -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                analytics.logScrollPosition(index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>副作用 API 确保外部操作的启动/重启/清理与 Composition 生命周期同步</li>\n<li><code>LaunchedEffect</code>：协程副作用，key 变化时取消重启；<code>DisposableEffect</code>：注册/注销配对</li>\n<li><code>SideEffect</code>：每次重组后同步执行，无清理；<code>rememberUpdatedState</code>：闭包刷新不重启</li>\n<li><code>produceState</code>/<code>snapshotFlow</code>：在 Compose State 与外部响应式世界之间桥接</li>\n<li>副作用的 key 设计决定了重启频率——key 太宽导致频繁重启，key 太窄导致读取过时值</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"state-hoisting-patterns\">状态提升模式</a>——副作用应放在哪一层：Composable vs ViewModel</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../android-development/architecture-components/viewmodel\">Android 开发基础 · ViewModel</a>——ViewModel 的生命周期与 Compose 副作用的配合</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../kotlin-advanced/coroutines/coroutine-fundamentals\">Kotlin 进阶 · 协程基础</a>——LaunchedEffect 内的 suspend/cancel 语义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"副作用与生命周期","id":"副作用与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LaunchedEffect：协程副作用","id":"launchedeffect-协程副作用"},{"level":2,"text":"DisposableEffect：资源管理","id":"disposableeffect-资源管理"},{"level":2,"text":"SideEffect：每次重组后同步","id":"sideeffect-每次重组后同步"},{"level":2,"text":"rememberUpdatedState：闭包刷新","id":"rememberupdatedstate-闭包刷新"},{"level":2,"text":"produceState：非 Compose 到 State 的桥接","id":"producestate-非-compose-到-state-的桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"snapshotFlow：State 到 Flow 的桥接","id":"snapshotflow-state-到-flow-的桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"图形与 Canvas 绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/graphics-and-canvas"},"next":{"title":"Navigation Compose 进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/architecture/navigation-compose"}}